# Backend tasks — commands filled in during implementation.
#
#   make run              run the API locally
#   make build            build the binary
#   make test             unit + service + handler tests
#   make test-integration integration tests against a scratch database
#   make lint             golangci-lint run
#   make fmt              gofmt
#   make generate         sqlc generate
#   make migrate-up / migrate-down / migrate-create
#   make seed             load content seed data
#   make vuln             govulncheck
